# BRIEF: Search file contents live with ripgrep and fzf, open matches in Vim
# DESC: Re-run ripgrep on every keystroke inside an fzf picker with a bat
# DESC: preview of the matched line. Enter opens the match in Vim at the
# DESC: right line; multi-selected matches open as a quickfix list.
# USAGE: rfv [initial-query]
# DEPS: rg, fzf, bat
#
